{"unit_id":"KonataRings__dsh-pku-cluster#caveat-1","repo":"KonataRings/dsh-pku-cluster","commit":"2abcf9002bd0c072fdf30fe3e48a111c6909bb03","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pku-cluster 使用前须知：首次启用会在 WSL 或本机的 ~/.pku-cluster 写入登录驱动、命令助手和连接配置；账号配置文件权限设为 600。密码与 OTP 经标准输入传给登录驱动，不写入配置文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:139-167","resources/login.py:85-88","lib/index.js:535-536"]}
